        <headline>Wind Advisory issued September 25 at 2:02AM EDT until September 27 at 6:00AM EDT by NWS Albany NY</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...North winds 15 to 25 mph with gusts 40 to 50 mph expected.

* WHERE...Litchfield County, Connecticut

* WHEN...From 2 PM this afternoon to 6 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Gusty winds will blow around unsecured objects. Tree
limbs could be blown down and a few power outages may result.
</description>
        <instruction>Winds this strong can make driving difficult, especially for high
profile vehicles. Use extra caution.</instruction>
